  "description": "Stanza's English NLP pipeline in .NET: tokenization and sentence splitting, multi-word token expansion, part-of-speech tags and morphological features, lemmas, dependency parsing, named entities, constituency parsing and sentence sentiment. Runs Stanza's own pretrained models through TorchSharp, with output identical to Python Stanza. Add TorchSharp-cpu (or TorchSharp-cuda-*) for the native libtorch.",
